    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "icon": "page"
                },
                {
                  "boldText": "Lesson 1 • Bob’s Day at Work"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Bob works as a manager in a furniture store. Peter, his boss, is not happy about sales. Bob’s new advertising campaign hasn’t helped. Peter decides to fire him."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "card": false,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Bob, I hate to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "break the news"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", but our sales were down again last month."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Down again, Peter?"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yeah. These days, everybody's shopping at our competition, Honest Abe's Furniture Store."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "But everything in there "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "costs an arm and a leg"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "That's true. They do charge "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "top dollar"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "And their salespeople are very strange. They really "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "give me the creeps!"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, they must be doing something right over there. Meanwhile, we're "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "about to"
                },
                {
                  "text":	" "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "belly-up"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. I thought my new advertising campaign would "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "save the day"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Let's face it"
                },
                {
                  "text": ": your advertising campaign was a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "real flop"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well then I'll "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "go back to the drawing board"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "It's too late for that. You're fired!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "What? You're "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "giving me the ax"
                },
                {
                  "text": "?"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yes. I've already found a new manager. She's "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "as sharp as a tack"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Can't we even "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "talk this over"
                },
                {
                  "text": "? "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "After all"
                },
                {
                  "text": " , I've been working here for 10 years!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "There's "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"no point in "
                },
                {
                  "text":	"arguing, Bob. I've already "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"made up my mind"
                },
                {
                  "text":	"."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Oh well, "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"at least"
                },
                {
                  "text":	" I won't have to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"put up with"
                },
                {
                  "text":	" your nonsense anymore! Good-bye to you and good-bye to this "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"dead-end job"
                },
                {
                  "text":	"."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Peter: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Please leave before I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"lose my temper"
                },
                {
                  "text":	"!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ribbon": {
