        },
        {
          "title": "1. Now fill in the blanks with the correct answer."
        },
        {
          "fillExercises": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.1 That luxury car must have",
                      "correctAnswer": ["cost an arm and a leg"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	"it’s incredibly expensive!"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.2 Our plan didn’t work as expected, so we’ll have to ",
                      "correctAnswer": ["go back to the drawing board"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	"and try again."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.3 The lawyer was",
                      "correctAnswer": ["sharp as a tack","as sharp as a tack"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	", quickly dismantling the opposing counsel’s arguments."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.4 That old, dark house at the end of the street really",
                      "correctAnswer": ["gives me the creeps"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	"."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.5 After the power went out, the technician arrived just in time to fix it and",
                      "correctAnswer": ["save the day"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.6 She had to",
                      "correctAnswer": ["put up with"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	"her noisy neighbors for years before moving out."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.7 They paid",
                      "correctAnswer": ["top dollar"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	"for that designer handbag, but they didn’t mind."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.8 I hate to",
                      "correctAnswer": ["break the news"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text":	"but your application wasn’t approved."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "block": [
                    {
                      "text": "1.9",
                      "correctAnswer": ["There’s no point"]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "arguing with him — he never changes his mind."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "2. Choose the missing word:"
        },
        {
          "radioExercises": [
            {
              "question": [
                {
                  "text": "2.1 I can't believe you bought a couch at Honest Abe's. Everything in that store costs an arm and a _____ . "
                }
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "option": "foot",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "leg",
                  "isCorrect": true
                },
                {
                  "option": "hand",
                  "isCorrect": false
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "question": [
                {
                  "text": "2.2 After Bob found out that his advertising campaign failed, he wanted to go back to the drawing _____ ."
                }
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "option": "board",
                  "isCorrect": true
                },
                {
                  "option": "table",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "room",
                  "isCorrect": false
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "question": [
                {
                  "text": "2.3 When somebody isn't listening to you, there's no _____ in trying to argue with them."
                }
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "option": "edge",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "tip",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "point",
                  "isCorrect": true
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "question": [
                {
                  "text": "2.4 José is really smart. He's as sharp as a _____ . "
                }
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "option": "tack",
                  "isCorrect": true
                },
                {
                  "option": "nail",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "screw",
                  "isCorrect": false
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "question": [
                {
                  "text": "2.5 The salespeople at Honest Abe's always look angry and never speak to anybody. No wonder they _____ Bob the creeps."
                }
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "option": "take",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "give",
                  "isCorrect": true
                },
                {
                  "option": "allow",
                  "isCorrect": false
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "question": [
                {
                  "text": "2.6 Bob got fired. He isn't looking forward to _____ the news to his family. "
                }
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "option": "breaking",
                  "isCorrect": true
                },
                {
                  "option": "craking",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "saying",
                  "isCorrect": false
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "question": [
                {
                  "text": "2.7 Bob thought his new advertisements would bring in lots of customers and save the _____ . "
                }
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "option": "morning",
                  "isCorrect": false
                },
                {
                  "option": "night",
